  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manufacturing Africa main contract fees (McKinsey). These are contract costs which are International Climate Finance eligible and activities reduce carbon emissions from manufacturing through thought leadership as well as delivering technical assistance and supporting investments that facilitate climate change mitigation and or adaptation across Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
